On the Fano graph, as `k → 0` at fixed `Δ > 1`: `v → 0`, `ω → J(Δ−1)`, hence `T(k) = 16(Δ−1)²k² + O(k⁴)`, `R(k) = 1 − 16(Δ−1)²k² + O(k⁴)` — **total
