+**PROVE.**  For every real `t`,
+
+`||Q exp(-itH)Psi|| <= min{1,(w+beta)/(a_5-c)}`,
+
+`<exp(-itH)Psi,Q exp(-itH)Psi>
+ <= min{1,[(w+beta)/(a_5-c)]^2}`,
