+with seven or more walls cannot reach `{1,3}` in one D16 bond move.
+
+**<2>4.**  The Schur row/column estimate for this weighted bipartite adjacency
+matrix gives
+`||B|| <= (J/2)sqrt(3*5)=J sqrt(15)/2`.
