+projection `Q` in Section 1.
+
+**<2>3. QED.**
+
+**<1>3. PROVE.**  The first estimate of D51-U holds at `t=0`.
+
+**<2>1.**  Since `Psi in Ran 1_I(H)` and `I=[c-w,c+w]`, spectral calculus
