+statement of D51-U.
+
+**<2>4. QED.**
+
+**<1>6. QED.**
+
+## 3. Lamport proof of D51-F
+
+**<1>1. PROVE.**  The bounds (D51.2) hold.
+
+**<2>1.**  For `Re z<a_5`, Section 2 <1>2 gives
+`||(C-z)^{-1}|| <= (a_5-Re z)^{-1}`.
