+*Justification.* D51-U Section 2 <1>1 and <2>1.
+
+**<2>3.**  Resolvent differentiation gives
+`partial_z Sigma(z)=B^*(C-z)^{-2}B`; the same estimates prove the second
+bound in (D51.2).
