+
+**<2>4. QED.**
+
+**<1>2. PROVE.**  The Feshbach identity (D51.3) holds.
+
+**<2>1.**  Relative to `Ran P direct-sum Ran Q`,
+`H-z` has blocks `[[A-z,B^*],[B,C-z]]`.
